"entity": {
"name": "Volex plc",
"description": "Volex Plc engages in the provision of cabling solutions for servicing consumer electronics, telecommunications, data centers, medical equipment, and the automotive industry. . Its products include data transfer cables, electric vehicle grid plugs, power cords, plugs, connectors, receptacles, and data center power cables. It operates through the following geographical segments: North America, Europe, and Asia. The company was founded by Meyer Hart Goldstone and James Henry Ward in 1892 and is headquartered in Basingstoke, the United Kingdom.",
"rbics_econ": "Technology",
"rbics_sector": "Electronic Components and Manufacturing",
